<!-- LAYOUT CONTRACT
     Maps plugins/code/skills/code-workflow/SKILL.md

     SPINE     x=1540..1920 — Phase 0 → 10
     LEFT_COL  x=660..980  — explain, ticket, awaiting, repair, review_fix
     RIGHT     x=2380..2940 — subagents; blocked at x=2440

     EXCLUSIVE EDGE BUSES (≥40px apart; long-haul must not enter a solid vertex AABB):
       x=480  repair → blocked (west descent)
       x=520  awaiting → END
       x=560  explain → END
       x=600  review_fix → verify climb
       x=1080 findings (security/code → review_fix)
       x=1180 repair → verify loop
       x=2180 advisory
       x=2300 blocked drain (enter blocked from TOP only)
       y=1960 review_fix re-verify collector (above repair)
       y=1995 repair re-verify collector
       y=3080 bottom (repair → blocked BOTTOM)

     Legend/ambient stay x≤480 so left buses run in the gutter 520–640.
-->
